               & LF
               & "- An element may itself be a fixed array, a slice or an "
               & "`any C`; the binding keeps its complete type."
               & LF
               & "- A struct or `any C` source is evaluated once, and walk"
               & "ed through its `first`, `at_end`, `item` and `next` ([13"
