               & "|---|---|"
               & LF
               & "| `[n of v]` | the count `n`; it can also infer a local "
               & "or module binding's type |"
               & LF
               & "| `[of v]` | the destination's written type |"
               & LF
               & "| `[e1, ..., ek, of v]` | the destination's written type"
