               & " than the work that had deferred them; D237 later made t"
               & "hat note ""this is transferred to Language evolution"" and"
               & " D246 made it state the form's standing."
               & LF
               & LF
               & "This is an ownership correction and not a language chang"
               & "e, and the reason it can be one is that the refusal was "
               & "already normative. [1790]'s `scalar_name` production spe"
               & "lls thirteen names and has never spelled these three, so"
               & " the enabled kernel grammar does not admit them and neve"
               & "r has; a program writing one is refused by the specifica"
