               & Character'Val (226)
               & Character'Val (128)
               & Character'Val (148)
               & " x86-64 masks to five bits at 32-bit and six at 64, whic"
               & "h is the masking [0320] already declined for over-wide a"
               & "mounts.",
            when 14 =>
               "Chosen: `usize`. A size and an alignment are counts of b"
               & "ytes on the machine being compiled for, which is what [0"
               & "160] says `usize` is for, and a measurement that default"
