               & "expression operands remain outside [1820]'s measurement "
               & "grammar. The spelling stays contextual rather than joini"
               & "ng [1760]'s reserved words.",
            when 165 =>
               "Chosen: `place op= value` evaluates `place` once, reads "
               & "its existing scalar value, evaluates `value`, applies th"
               & "e corresponding [1820] binary operator and writes the re"
               & "sult through that retained place. The thirteen forms are"
               & " `+=`, `-=`, `*=`, `/=`, `%=`, `&=`, `|=`, `^=`, `<<=`, "
               & "`>>=`, `+%=`, `-%=` and `*%=`. Destination evaluation an"
