               & "nternal address, not reconstructed after the expression."
               & LF
               & LF
               & "The destination must be assigned on every arriving path "
               & "because the operation reads its old value; success leave"
               & "s it assigned. It needs the same binding or reference wr"
               & "ite permission as plain assignment. Both operands have t"
               & "he destination scalar type under [1890]: ordinary arithm"
