            when 188 =>
               "Chosen: a range subtype is its base integer type restric"
               & "ted to a run of that type's own values, and not a new ty"
               & "pe. `percent` and `u8` have the same representation, the"
               & " same width, the same operand rules and the same operato"
               & "r results, so `p + 1`, `p & mask`, `-p` and `p >> 2` are"
