               & Character'Val (128)
               & Character'Val (148)
               & " integer literals, unary minus and target-independent `+"
               & " - * / %` "
               & Character'Val (226)
               & Character'Val (128)
               & Character'Val (148)
               & " so `u8 range 0..(200 / 2)` is written and `u8 range 0.."
               & "300` is L0300 because `u8` holds neither bound. A lower "
