               & LF
               & LF
               & "The check happens where [0660] says and nowhere else: st"
               & "oring a value into a place whose declared type is the su"
               & "btype "
               & Character'Val (226)
               & Character'Val (128)
               & Character'Val (148)
               & " a local or module binding initializer, an assignment, a"
               & " compound assignment, [1900]'s `inc` and `dec`, a call a"
               & "rgument and a named return "
               & Character'Val (226)
               & Character'Val (128)
               & Character'Val (148)
               & " and applying the subtype name to a value [0700]. All of"
               & " them reuse D168's exact-range path. A value the compile"
               & "r knows and the bounds exclude is L0300, which includes "
               & "[0540]'s `zeroed`, because `zeroed` is the base type's a"
