               & LF
               & LF
               & "A preceding successful comparison on an ordinary integer"
               & " is not a carried subtype proof. For example, `fail inva"
               & "lid when n > 100` followed by `p: percent = n` handles a"
               & "n out-of-range `u8` recoverably, but the store still emi"
