               & "overable validation followed by range-subtype constructi"
               & "on."
               & LF
               & LF
               & "Six positions are refused by name, and together they are"
               & " what makes the guarantee true rather than decorative, b"
               & "ecause each is a path by which an unchecked value could "
               & "enter constrained storage: a struct field, a fixed-array"
               & " element, a `ptr`/`[]` target, `addr` of a constrained p"
               & "lace, an `extern (c)` signature whose named return Landi"
               & "n never assigns, and a generic type argument. The first "
               & "four and the last report L0304 by name; the external sig"
