               & " element extent without array-sized placement metadata; "
               & "a variant keeps its existing internal tag/payload rules."
               & " Nested nominal fields use their own declared policies. "
               & "Anonymous structs stay natural. Zero-size fields still h"
               & "onor alignment. Target byte arithmetic checks rounding a"
               & "nd extents, including the selected target's object-size "
