               & "on refusal, which D236 records as a permanent boundary."
               & LF
               & LF
               & "`name(value)` constructs that identity from one value of"
               & " its exact base. `base(value)` extracts that same base f"
               & "rom a distinct value; an ordinary alias may name a struc"
               & "tural base. These operations preserve bytes and do not i"
