               & "visible in source. In particular, two values of the same"
               & " distinct numeric type still inherit no arithmetic opera"
               & "tion."
               & LF
               & LF
               & "Generic deduction, signature identity, reference referen"
               & "ts and conformance keys retain the nominal identity. A d"
               & "istinct type may declare its own conformance, and that c"
               & "onformance supports ordinary constrained and erased disp"
               & "atch. It inherits no user conformance. D428 reversed thi"
