               & "ns "
               & Character'Val (226)
               & Character'Val (128)
               & Character'Val (148)
               & " `[]percent` apart from `[]u8`, a generic instance keyed"
               & " by its bounds "
               & Character'Val (226)
               & Character'Val (128)
               & Character'Val (148)
               & " which is a second nominal identity beside [0650]'s, wit"
               & "h its own relaxation question, while [0440] calls its re"
