            when 239 =>
               "Chosen: all five are withdrawn. A field holds the target"
               & "'s own byte order, which `compiler.byte_order` names [15"
               & "60]; a program converts another order where the bytes cr"
               & "oss, with shifts [0320] or an ordinary function. Inlinin"
               & "g is the optimizer's decision under D211, and no source "
