               & " are rewritten."
               & LF
               & LF
               & "No prototype, derived program, `core` module or example "
               & "writes any of the five. A per-field order would make eve"
               & "ry load and store of that field a byte swap, leave `addr"
               & "` of the field an ordinary `ptr u16` that reads the wron"
               & "g value, so that addressability would need the refusals "
               & "packed fields have, put static images through a second b"
