               & "nd that library source to it, so the three cannot drift "
               & "apart unseen."
               & LF
               & LF
               & "A level changes which instructions the backend selects, "
               & "which Cortex assembly text the checker admits, and which"
               & " instructions the toolchain accepts, and nothing else. T"
               & "he Cortex text check uses the level so its default-only "
               & "instruction allowlist does not refuse valid instructions"
