               & "e zero-divisor and minimum-over-minus-one guards, rather"
               & " than a call to the runtime's `__aeabi_idivmod`; a 64-bi"
               & "t one still calls the runtime. RV64 indexed address calc"
               & "ulation uses Zba's `sh1add`, `sh2add` or `sh3add` when i"
               & "ts scale fits, XTheadBa's `th.addsl` when selected witho"
               & "ut Zba, and the same shift/add sequence at baseline; bou"
               & "nds and overflow checks are unchanged. Beyond that: ever"
               & "y level of a family shares one layout, one calling conve"
