               & LF
               & LF
               & "Initialized allocation composes with this state machine "
               & "using ordinary library routines. `new` accepts an `escap"
               & "ing` complete initial value, allocates its target extent"
               & " and alignment, stores it and then returns the pointer; "
               & "`delete` consumes one pointer binding and frees that ori"
