               & "O_CREAT | O_TRUNC` and mode `0666`, subject to the proce"
               & "ss umask."
               & LF
               & LF
               & "The required `world.same_file(left, right)` entry compar"
               & "es filesystem identity without opening or truncating eit"
               & "her path. The input `left` must exist and be inspectable"
               & "; any failure inspecting it is `io_failed`. An absent `r"
