               & " Close maps a nonzero libc result to `io_failed`. On an "
               & "otherwise successful path that failure is observable; wh"
               & "en close is a reached `undo` while another declared fail"
               & "ure is already propagating, D133 preserves the primary a"
               & "tom and cleanup cannot replace it."
               & LF
               & LF
               & "The `core/io` module contains the target-neutral `world`"
               & " concept, adapters and caller-backed `memory` provider. "
               & "The libc-backed `system` provider and its argument root "
               & "live in `hosted/system`, over the `extern(c)` declaratio"
