               & " contract above remains unchanged."
               & LF
               & LF
               & "The bounded `core/io.memory` provider implements the sam"
               & "e capability from caller-supplied file descriptors, cont"
               & "ent buffers, argument descriptors and standard-output/er"
               & "ror buffers. It makes no host calls and allocates no sto"
               & "rage. `memory_over` retains those four supplied slices t"
               & "hrough its result's `from` clause; since D285 and D288 i"
