               & LF
               & LF
               & "Both `arena name do` and the builtin `arena` parameter t"
               & "ype remain refused by name, now against the derived host"
               & "ed application. That work owns the first complete progra"
               & "m using prototype 4's W7 helper-returned configuration, "
               & "and precedes the hosted parity gate. It inherits all fou"
               & "r D191 questions: builtin type and ordinary allocator co"
