               & "t use; a push, insert, remove or release while it lives "
               & "is L0315. `vec.last`, `map.contains`, `map.clear` and `m"
               & "ap.reserve` complete the surfaces the consumers reach fo"
               & "r.",
            when 272 =>
               "Chosen: `diag.warning` and `diag.error` are atoms and `d"
               & "iag.severity` is `warning | error`. The log concept's `n"
               & "ote` receives it through erased dispatch, a bounded entr"
               & "y stores it, `severity_of` returns it and a `match` over"
